wiki/Read_Thoughts\" title=\"Read Thoughts\">Read Thoughts</a></span></li>\n</ul></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Conditions_with_the_same_stack_ID\"> Conditions with the same stack ID </span></h2>\nConditions with the <a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stack ID\">stack ID</a> <code>DETECT_THOUGHTS</code>, only one of these can be applied at the same time:<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"width:100%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n  <th>Condition</th>\n  <th>Effects</th>\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Detect_Thoughts\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Detect_Thoughts_(Condition)\" title=\"Detect Thoughts (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f6/Detect_Thoughts_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Detect_Thoughts_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f6/Detect_Thoughts_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Detect_Thoughts_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f6/Detect_Thoughts_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Detect_Thoughts_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Detect Thoughts\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f6/Detect_Thoughts_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Detect_Thoughts_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f6/Detect_Thoughts_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Detect Thoughts</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>The affected creature can read the thoughts of certain creatures while talking to them.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Hoots'_Hooch:_Gifted\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hoots%27_Hooch:_Gifted_(Condition)\" title=\"Hoots' Hooch: Gifted (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f6/Detect_Thoughts_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Detect_Thoughts_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f6/Detect_Thoughts_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Detect_Thoughts_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f6/Detect_Thoughts_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Detect_Thoughts_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Hoots' Hooch: Gifted\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f6/Detect_Thoughts_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Detect_Thoughts_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f6/Detect_Thoughts_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Hoots%27_Hooch:_Gifted_(Condition)\" title=\"Hoots' Hooch: Gifted (Condition)\">Hoots' Hooch: Gifted</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>You can read minds, but become <a href=\"/wiki/Vulnerable\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Vulnerable\">Vulnerable</a> to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Psychic\" title=\"Psychic\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Psychic_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Psychic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Psychic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Psychic\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Psychic_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Psychic\" title=\"Psychic\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-psychic\">Psychic</span></a> damage.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</t